    ['AI-011-F01',conceptId,conceptName,'AI system registry and accountability','Create versioned records for system identity, intended/prohibited use, accountable owner, risk owner and lifecycle.','Register/list a system; reject duplicate or unsafe IDs; require explicit model/tool declarations.','P0 - MVP','M0','Done','Vatsal Shah'],
    ['AI-011-F02',conceptId,conceptName,'Model, tool, data and human checkpoint inventory','Record model/provider/version, tools/MCP scopes, data source categories, affected groups and human checkpoints.','Sample system stores all declarations and reports missing owner/context fields.','P0 - MVP','M0','Done','Vatsal Shah'],
